============== Gadget examples from SEH to nSEH =======================

pop reg/pop reg/ret

add esp, 4/add esp, 4/ret

pop reg/add esp, 4/ret
add esp, 4/pop reg/ret

add esp,[8/14/1c/...]/ret  ( add esp, 8/ret | add esp, 14/ret | add esp, 1c/ret | ...)
add ebp,[c/24/30...]/ret

jmp dword ptr [esp + nn] nn = 8/14/1c/...
call dword ptr [esp + nn] nn = 8/14/1c/...

jmp dword ptr [ebp + nn] nn = c/24/30...
call dword ptr [ebp + nn] nn = c/24/30...

popad/call ebp
popad/jmp ebp

popad/call edx
popad/jmp edx

popad/call eax
popad/jmp eax 

