=============== Memory layout during _exception_handler calls (POPAD technique)====================
0:000> dd /c1 esp
0012f84c  7c9032a8 ; -----> EDI
0012f850  0012f934 ; -----> ESI
0012f854  0012fe7c ; -----> EBP [ESP + 8]
0012f858  0012f950 ; skipped
0012f85c  0012f908 ; -----> EBX
0012f860  0012fe7c ; -----> EDX [ESP + 14]
0012f864  7c9032bc ; -----> ECX
0012f868  0012fe7c ; <----- EAX [ESP + 1c]

popad algorithm:
EDI ← Pop();
ESI ← Pop();
EBP ← Pop();
increment ESP by 4 (* skip next 4 bytes of stack * ESP ← Pop() is just moves ESP + 4, without poping into ESP any value ) 
EBX ← Pop();
EDX ← Pop();
ECX ← Pop();
EAX ← Pop();

